  "historical_readme_lightbeams_mentions": [
    {
      "line": 403,
      "text": "- Some thrash driver capabilities could be set in thrash.ini: FogSupport and LightBeams. For example, it allows to override hardcoded values and allow to use fog for d3d thrash driver (if this driver supports it). It allows to use fog in the dx6 thrash driver from NFS4/3DSETUP."
    }
